OL,3,GNEWSAFunding to transform park a 'huge
OL,4,Aboost'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community group says funding to help
OL,7,Ftransform a park is a "huge boost" for
OL,8,Fthe project.
OL,10,FNorth Shields-based Friends of Chirton
OL,11,FDene Park will receive a #19,000 grant
OL,12,Fto help purchase tools and deliver
OL,13,Fprojects to enhance the area, support
OL,14,Fvolunteers and improve local
OL,15,Fbiodiversity.
OL,17,FThe group will benefit from a share of
OL,18,Ffunding secured by North Tyneside
OL,19,FCouncil through Northern Powergrid's
OL,20,FSocial Impact Programme.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
